  "title": "คุณค่าของคน ไม่ได้ลดทอนเหลือแค่ความเหมาะกับบทบาทหรือผลงาน",
  "excerpt": "Operational judgment should not collapse human dignity into organizational utility.",
  "body_html": "<span class=\"principle\">PR-004 · ความเสถียร: รากฐาน (constitutional)</span>\n<h2>หลักการ (ต้นฉบับ)</h2>\n<blockquote><p>The value of a person is not reducible to role fit, output, status, or one evaluation.</p></blockquote>\n<h2>เหตุผล</h2>\n<p>Operational judgment should not collapse human dignity into organizational utility.</p>\n<h2>ตัวอย่างการใช้ผิด</h2>\n<p>Calling a team member incapable because they are unsuitable for one role.</p>\n<h2>เงื่อนไขทบทวน</h2>\n<p>The wording may be refined, but the dignity distinction remains.</p>\n<h2>ขอบเขต</h2>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:'Noto Sans Thai',sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#5d6b78;background:#f1eee7;border:1px solid #e8e4db;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:99px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;display:inline-block;\">people</span><span style=\"font-family:'Noto Sans Thai',sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#5d6b78;background:#f1eee7;border:1px solid #e8e4db;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:99px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;display:inline-block;\">HR</span><span style=\"font-family:'Noto Sans Thai',sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#5d6b78;background:#f1eee7;border:1px solid #e8e4db;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:99px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;display:inline-block;\">leadership</span><span style=\"font-family:'Noto Sans Thai',sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#5d6b78;background:#f1eee7;border:1px solid #e8e4db;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:99px;margin:0 6px 6px 0;display:inline-block;\">education</span></div>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Noto Sans Thai',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#9aa5b1;\">ที่มา: <a href=\"https://github.com/morrocwi/cpg_book/blob/main/personal_reasoning/00_PERSONAL_REASONING_FOUNDATION_AND_PROTOCOL.yaml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#0ea5e9;\">PRF-001 · PR-004</a></p>",
